            "end_line": 54,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// Scenario 1 - SKIP: unknown \"-c\" and \"-d\" are kept as arguments alongside \"arg1\" and \"arg2\". final CommandLine skipResult = parser.parse(optionsKnowingOnlyAandB, null, DefaultParser.NonOptionAction.SKIP, COMMAND_LINE);"
