            "line_count": 14,
            "preview": "assertEquals(2, skipResult.getOptions().length, \"Only -a and -b should be recognized as options\"); assertEquals(4, skipResult.getArgs().length, \"-c, -d, arg1 and arg2 should be collected as arguments\"); assertTrue(skipResult.hasOption(\"a\"))"
